{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/62f057e16601dfef3816179e72baa8b2.avif?t=1765853910\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bottom-screen idle game that won't disrupt your work or study. Research tech, farm crops, raise animals, recruit survivors, unlock mines, hunt mutants, fend off aberrations, gear up your squad, craft with machinery, build your shelter\u2014and conquer the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Crops:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign planting tasks to your shelter survivors. They'll autonomously work\u2014gathering wild plants, sowing, watering, fertilizing, and reaping bountiful harvests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.poster.avif?t=1765853910\" width=766 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.webm?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.mp4?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Animals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors assigned to ranching will automatically fetch tools from the storage, capture animals, raise them, provide feed, and eventually yield raw meat and other materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.poster.avif?t=1765853910\" width=712 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.webm?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.mp4?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Machinery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a dozen unique mechanical devices. Power your grid, fuel your machines. Forge the ultimate shelter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.poster.avif?t=1765853910\" width=714 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.webm?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.mp4?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine Hunting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perilous mines don't just yield ore\u2014they teem with mutated beasts. Some are docile, others ferocious. Arm your squad to the teeth and hunt them down. You might just score an unexpected haul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3372a1b592f89ec034665b0097e0df37.poster.avif?t=1765853910\" width=714 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3372a1b592f89ec034665b0097e0df37.webm?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3372a1b592f89ec034665b0097e0df37.mp4?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Tide Incoming!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your shelter thrives, it draws the attention of vile mutants. Equip your elite combat squad, repel the onslaught, and protect everything you've built!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.poster.avif?t=1765853910\" width=714 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.webm?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.mp4?t=1765853910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More weapons, more mechanics, more gameplay\u2014all await your discovery!!!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617390?t=1765853910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3617390?t=1765853910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/27f6730bcbf09457092e61e13cb1289933642f05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765853910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/27f6730bcbf09457092e61e13cb1289933642f05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765853910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}